  "semantic_predicates": [
    "Root fixed actual observer owns before and after objects; caller JSON/hash/ACK cannot construct a genuine process/session/broker/cut.",
    "Complete container IDs are unique, exact all-host set, strictly ordered by ID; same before and after set, daemon/current PG/image/process/native/start/restart/network/precise twelve mounts and legacy producers unchanged as required by original predicates.",
    "Every mounts array uniquely sorted by destination, all complete original projections retained; no sample/truncation/project-only replacement.",
    "ActualAssetsMount equals the complete actual Docker Mounts object including original absence/null/property values; Type/Name/Source/Destination/RW/Driver/Mode/Propagation are not a five-field replacement. Unknown properties reject rather than disappear.",
    "Actual dedicated export and companion volumes have distinct nonempty names and actual disjoint canonical host mapped roots; RO assets actual longest-covering mount and no RW alias or running old producer as in original FreshMounts.",
    "Legacy array equals the exact original project-and-not-current-CID filter of complete_container_projection, not caller-filled or guessed empty.",
    "Host mount digest retains its independently adopted canonical five-field/twelve-row preimage; complete AssetsMount/ContainerProjection and descriptor/frame/header digests are different domains.",
    "Root reads exact actual binary header and frame1 at before-held host companion mapping journals/<binding>/epochs/<epoch>; full original format/length/checksum/identity/sequence validation, same held/named metadata, genesis only, payload bytes exact equals original lifecycle descriptor bytes.",
    "Existing Prefix::check sequence>=2 remains unchanged; new genesis reader returns only DATA, no adoption/repair/writer/RootJournal authority.",
    "BrokerInstalled retains exact original base fields/limits and adds only three fields; new ACK uses same original correlated operation, no duplicate/caller retry. Root ACK emitted after actual post-genesis observation and durable record only.",
    "I0 holds actual installed broker/resources/futures until authenticated ACK and exact immutable record validation; S5 fills original companion records with own real Descriptor and true host DATA before first work.",
    "ACK loss, deadline, residue, unknown sync, data mismatch and cancellation keep original installed resources in negative retained cleanup; no false success, drop-to-retry, fake Q0/capture or late readback proof of original ACK success.",
    "Original total/request/cutover/freshness clocks are not renewed. New observed_unix_ms is actual Root clock DATA, not caller clock/TTL authority.",
    "All records/arrays/raw-byte encoding and every repeated stat/read/hash are prepaid against their original meters; no credentials or environment values in the body.",
    "Original Install admin SQL/native gates finish before actual original close. No new post-close SQL or pool is introduced; closed session is never resurrected. Existing I0 actual broker/runtime bootstrap and genesis have their original owned SQL gates.",
    "Original cutover Docker::ids MAX_CONTAINERS=1024 remains a hard smaller cap for complete all-host and legacy arrays; cumulative100000/per-array shape cannot enlarge it."
  ],
